.SH "نام (NAME)"
cd-convert \- Color Manager Testing Tool
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBcd\-convert\fR\ 'u
\fBcd\-convert\fR [\fB\-\-verbose\fR]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
This manual page documents briefly the
\fBcd\-convert\fR
command\&.
.PP
\fBcd\-convert\fR
allows an administrator to create IT8 files, such as
\&.ti3,
\&.ccmx
in various ways\&.
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.PP
This program follows the usual
GNU
command line syntax, with long options starting with two dashes (`\-\*(Aq)\&. A summary of options is included below\&.
.PP
\fB\-\-help\fR
.RS 4
Show summary of options\&.
.RE
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
.PP
This manual page was written by Richard Hughes
<richard@hughsie\&.com>\&.
